### Configurar variável de ambiente
@host = http://localhost:5297

### Fazer login para obter o token
POST {{host}}/api/Usuario/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos.pereira@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "senhaSegura789"
}

### Extrair o token da resposta do login
@token = 
### ==================================================
### OPERAÇÕES DE COTAS
### ==================================================

### 1. Buscar cota por ID
GET {{host}}/api/cotas/48
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Buscar cota com detalhes (incluindo consórcio e usuário)
GET {{host}}/api/cotas/48/detailed
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Buscar todas as cotas de um consórcio
GET {{host}}/api/cotas/by-consorcio/10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Buscar todas as cotas de um usuário
GET {{host}}/api/cotas/by-user/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Buscar todas as cotas ativas
GET {{host}}/api/cotas/active
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Buscar todas as cotas contempladas
GET {{host}}/api/cotas/contemplated
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Registrar pagamento em uma cota
POST {{host}}/api/cotas/24/register-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "valorPago": 4166.67
}
### 8 Registrar pagamento de 2 parcelas
POST {{host}}/api/cotas/24/register-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "valorPago": 79999.8
}

### 9. Contemplar uma cota (simular sorteio)
POST {{host}}/api/cotas/24/contemplate
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Remover usuário de uma cota (apenas se não tiver pagamentos)
DELETE {{host}}/api/cotas/3/remove-user
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Suspender uma cota 
PUT {{host}}/api/cotas/48/update-status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": 4
}

### 12. Reativar uma cota 
PUT {{host}}/api/cotas/24/update-status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": 3
}
